- `selectionPath`：与侧栏 `LHDataTable` 的 `selectedRowKeys` 同语义，提交时用 `selectedItemIds`。

### 5.3 `use-resource-form-engine` 分支

```ts
if (field.component === "dynamicTable" && field.dynamicTable) {
  return (
    <SharedField label={field.label} ...>
      <LHDynamicTable
        columns={field.dynamicTable.columns}
        records={getValueAtPath(values, path) ?? []}
        rowKey={field.dynamicTable.rowKey ?? "id"}
        selectable={field.dynamicTable.selectable}
        selectedRowKeys={getValueAtPath(values, selectionPath) ?? []}
        onSelectionChange={(keys) => updateFieldValue(selectionPath, keys)}
        isRowSelectable={(row) => evaluateConditions(row, rowSelectableWhen)}
        onCellAction={formContext?.onCellAction}
        embedded
        maxHeight={field.dynamicTable.maxHeight}
        ...
