| 容器 | `LHResourcePage` + `ResourceMeta.table` | `LHResourceForm` + `dynamicTable` |
| 表格组件 | `LHDataTable` → `LHDynamicTable` | 直接 `LHDynamicTable` |
| 列定义 | `task-assignment-board.ts` `table.columns` | **共享** `assignment-board-columns.ts` |
| link → detail | `LHResourcePage.openDetail` | `formContext.onCellAction` |
| 勾选 | `table.selectable` + bulkActions | `dynamicTable.selectable` + `selectionPath` |
| 数据加载 | `useResourceList` | Workflow 注入 `values.candidates` |

