## 调用链（简图）

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
  participant User
  participant Bar as LHTableBulkActionBar
  participant Page as LHResourcePage.handleBulkAction
  participant Mut as useResourceMutations.runBulkAction
  participant Reg as bulk-action-registry
  participant Handler as runAssignmentsBatchCancel
  participant API as apiClient DELETE

  User->>Bar: 勾选行 + 点「批量取消分配」
  Bar->>Page: onAction(merged batchCancel)
  Page->>Page: confirm 弹窗
  Page->>Mut: { resource: assignments, action, ids }
  Mut->>Reg: resolve("assignments", "batchCancel")
  Reg->>Handler: 已注册 handler
  loop 每个 assignment id
    Handler->>API: DELETE /owner/assignments/{id}
  end
  Mut->>Page: invalidate 列表
  Page->>Page: refresh()
```

---

## 和题目池 `taskAssignmentBoard` 的区别

| 资源 | `bulkActions` 同 key | 注册 handler | 实际 API |
|------|----------------------|--------------|----------|
| `assignments` | `batchCancel` | `runAssignmentsBatchCancel` | 按**分配 id** 多次 `DELETE` |
| `taskAssignmentBoard` | `batchCancel` | `runTaskAssignmentBoardBatchCancel` | `POST .../batch/cancel`（`taskId` + **itemIds**） |

题目池的 `ids` 是题目行 id，且需要侧栏/筛选里的 `taskId` 作为 `scope`（`resolveBulkActionScope` 从 `listQuery.filters` 推断）。

---

## 若没注册插件会怎样？

会落到 `dataProvider.custom` → `runBulkResourceAction`；`batchCancel` 没有 `bulkApi`，也不是 `enable/disable/delete`，会抛：

`Missing bulk action api for assignments:batchCancel`

所以 **`table.bulkActions` 只声明意图，真正实现必须在 `businessLowCodePlugin`（或别处 `bulkActions.register`）里挂上。**

